Date: Thu, 16 Jan 2025 14:32:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 673/913] plat-stm32mp1: stm32mp1_pwr: retrieve power domain
 state from EXTI

Instead of using proprietary genPD SMC method,
Get power domain state from the status of the EXTI IMR registers.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 866c2931666102c9d7630b7e2475f27e5c57a760 plat-stm32mp1: stm32mp1_pwr: retrieve power domain state from EXTI]
Change-Id: Id4ab669a86728845b486aef6a5884031c83a2f0f
Signed-off-by: Pascal Paillet <p.paillet@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/429401
Reviewed-by: Pascal PAILLET <p.paillet@st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Tested-by: Pascal PAILLET <p.paillet@st.com>
Reviewed-by: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
---
 .../nsec-service/stm32mp1_svc_setup.c         |   2 +
 core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/pm/context.h      |   2 +
